#: src/ui/main.qml:25
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Graphics processors"
msgstr "图形处理器"

#: src/ui/main.qml:31
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "No graphics processor was found."
msgstr "未找到图形处理器。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:33
msgctxt "@info %1 is a number"
msgid "This computer has %1 graphics processor."
msgid_plural "This computer has %1 graphics processors."
msgstr[0] "此计算机有 %1 个图形处理器。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:34
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "This computer has one graphics processor. Every program draws on it."
msgstr "此计算机有一个图形处理器。所有程序都在它上面绘制。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:63
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Draws the desktop"
msgstr "绘制桌面"

#: src/ui/main.qml:65
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Draws the desktop after the next login"
msgstr "下次登录后绘制桌面"

#: src/ui/main.qml:66
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Draws this session until the next login"
msgstr "在下次登录前绘制本次会话"

#: src/ui/main.qml:94
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Your account may not use this GPU. Add it to the render group to send "
"programs here."
msgstr "您的账户不能使用此 GPU。请将账户加入 render 组，以便把程序发送到这里。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:101
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This chip only shows a picture. It cannot draw 3D or decode video, so it is "
"never offered below."
msgstr "此芯片只负责显示画面，不能绘制 3D 或解码视频，因此下方不会提供它。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:111
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Display && Monitor…"
msgstr "显示和监控…"

#: src/ui/main.qml:116
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Power Management…"
msgstr "电源管理…"

#: src/ui/main.qml:127
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Main desktop GPU"
msgstr "桌面主 GPU"

#: src/ui/main.qml:132
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Draws the desktop:"
msgstr "绘制桌面的 GPU："

#: src/ui/main.qml:150
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The desktop and every window are put together on this GPU. A change applies "
"at the next login."
msgstr "桌面和所有窗口都在此 GPU 上合成。更改将在下次登录时生效。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:151
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "There is only one GPU to draw the desktop on."
msgstr "只有一个 GPU 可用于绘制桌面。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:159
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name"
msgid "This session still draws on %1 until you log in again."
msgstr "在您重新登录之前，此会话仍在 %1 上绘制。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:160
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name"
msgid "This session draws on %1."
msgstr "此会话在 %1 上绘制。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:166
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"A KWIN_DRM_DEVICES line in your own folder ~/.config/plasma-workspace/env is "
"used instead of this choice."
msgstr "您自己的文件夹 ~/.config/plasma-workspace/env 中的 KWIN_DRM_DEVICES 行将代替此选择生效。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:177
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Where programs draw"
msgstr "程序在哪里绘制"

#: src/ui/main.qml:232
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Players follow their choice from the next time they start. For a game in "
"Steam, set its launch options to: sparky-stereo-gpu-run --category games "
"%command%, and add --3d for a game you play in 3D. For any single program, "
"use the list below."
msgstr "播放器从下次启动起遵循此选择。对于 Steam 中的游戏，请将其启动选项设置为：sparky-stereo-gpu-run --category games %command%，以 3D 游玩的游戏请加上 --3d。对于单个程序，请使用下面的列表。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:243
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Programs"
msgstr "程序"

#: src/ui/main.qml:250
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This is the same setting as Run Using Dedicated Graphics in the application "
"menu. The other GPU is the one that does not draw the desktop. A change "
"applies the next time the program starts."
msgstr "这与应用程序菜单中的“使用独立显卡运行”是同一项设置。另一个 GPU 指不绘制桌面的那个。更改将在程序下次启动时生效。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:284
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name"
msgid "Now: %1. The program asks for this itself."
msgstr "当前：%1。该程序自己提出了此要求。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:285
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name"
msgid "Now: %1"
msgstr "当前：%1"

#: src/ui/main.qml:306
msgctxt "@info %1 is a number"
msgid "%1 more program is not shown. Type part of its name to find it."
msgid_plural ""
"%1 more programs are not shown. Type part of their name to find them."
msgstr[0] "还有 %1 个程序未显示。输入名称的一部分即可找到。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:315
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Video decoding"
msgstr "视频解码"

#: src/ui/main.qml:319
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Copy decoded video back"
msgstr "将解码的视频复制回来"

#: src/ui/main.qml:327
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Some players can use the GPU's video decoder only by copying every decoded "
"picture back to the processor. On some computers that drops more frames than "
"decoding in software. Players that show the decoded pictures where they are "
"do not need it, and a decoder you choose in a player is always used."
msgstr "有些播放器只有把每一帧解码后的画面复制回处理器，才能使用 GPU 的视频解码器。在某些计算机上，这比软件解码丢帧更多。直接在原处显示解码画面的播放器不需要它，而您在播放器中选择的解码器始终会被使用。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:339
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"MEDIA_GPU_ROUTE_COPY_BACK is set in this session and is used instead of this "
"choice."
msgstr "此会话中设置了 MEDIA_GPU_ROUTE_COPY_BACK，将代替此选择使用。"

#: src/ui/main.qml:350
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "GPU power"
msgstr "GPU 电源"

#: src/ui/main.qml:357
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"These save power when the power profile asks for it. They work for the "
"graphics chip in this computer, with one GPU or several."
msgstr "当电源配置要求时，这些选项可以省电。它们适用于此计算机的图形芯片，无论有一个还是多个 GPU。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:41
msgctxt "@item GPU name, then its PCI address when two GPUs have the same name"
msgid "%1 (%2)"
msgstr "%1 (%2)"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:51
msgctxt "@label kind of program"
msgid "Players"
msgstr "播放器"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:53
msgctxt "@label kind of program"
msgid "Games"
msgstr "游戏"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:55
msgctxt "@label kind of program"
msgid "Browsers"
msgstr "浏览器"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:59
msgctxt "@label kind of program"
msgid "Other programs"
msgstr "其他程序"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:65
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "the chosen GPU is not installed, so the main GPU"
msgstr "所选 GPU 未安装，因此使用主 GPU"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:68
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "the only GPU"
msgstr "唯一的 GPU"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:71
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "power saver profile"
msgstr "节能配置"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:74
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "performance profile"
msgstr "性能配置"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:77
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "balanced profile"
msgstr "平衡配置"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:80
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "the program's own setting"
msgstr "程序自己的设置"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:83
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "measured best for this model"
msgstr "在此型号上测得最佳"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:83
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "measured best on this computer"
msgstr "在此计算机上测得最佳"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:86
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "not measured on this computer yet"
msgstr "尚未在此计算机上测量"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:88
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "your choice"
msgstr "您的选择"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:141
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The graphics settings could not be saved."
msgstr "无法保存图形设置。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:146
msgctxt "@info %1 is a program's menu entry"
msgid "The setting for %1 could not be saved."
msgstr "无法保存 %1 的设置。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:151
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The power setting could not be changed. The power profile service may not "
"allow it."
msgstr "无法更改电源设置。电源配置服务可能不允许这样做。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:195
msgctxt "@label kind of GPU"
msgid "Integrated"
msgstr "集成"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:195
msgctxt "@label kind of GPU"
msgid "Discrete"
msgstr "独立"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:197
msgctxt "@label kind of GPU"
msgid "Display adapter only"
msgstr "仅显示适配器"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:203
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "No driver loaded"
msgstr "未加载驱动"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:203
msgctxt "@info %1 is a kernel driver name"
msgid "Driver: %1"
msgstr "驱动：%1"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:204
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "No screen attached"
msgstr "未连接屏幕"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:204
msgctxt "@info %1 is a list of screens"
msgid "Screens: %1"
msgstr "屏幕：%1"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:209
msgctxt "@info %1 is a list of kinds of program"
msgid "Used now for: %1"
msgstr "当前用于：%1"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:248
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox %1 is a GPU name"
msgid "Automatic (%1)"
msgstr "自动 (%1)"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:255 src/graphicskcm.cpp:307
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox %1 is a PCI address"
msgid "Missing GPU (%1)"
msgstr "缺失的 GPU (%1)"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:279
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自动"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:280
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Follow the power profile"
msgstr "跟随电源配置"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:291
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Integrated GPU"
msgstr "集成 GPU"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:294
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Discrete GPU"
msgstr "独立 GPU"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:322
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name, %2 the reason"
msgid "Started in 3D: %1, %2"
msgstr "以 3D 启动时：%1，%2"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:331
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name, %2 the reason"
msgid "Now: %1, %2"
msgstr "当前：%1，%2"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:357
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Power profile: Power Saver. Automatic draws games, browsers and other "
"programs on the integrated GPU."
msgstr "电源配置：节能。“自动”在集成 GPU 上绘制游戏、浏览器和其他程序。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:359
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Power profile: Performance. Automatic draws games, browsers and other "
"programs on the discrete GPU."
msgstr "电源配置：性能。“自动”在独立 GPU 上绘制游戏、浏览器和其他程序。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:363
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Power profile: Balanced. Automatic draws games, browsers and other programs "
"on the GPU that draws the desktop."
msgstr "电源配置：平衡。“自动”在绘制桌面的 GPU 上绘制游戏、浏览器和其他程序。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:375
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name"
msgid ""
"Automatic draws players, and any program started in 3D, on %1 whatever the "
"power profile, on battery too. This computer has not been measured yet, so "
"that is its discrete GPU."
msgstr "“自动”在 %1 上绘制播放器以及任何以 3D 启动的程序，无论电源配置如何，使用电池时也是如此。此计算机尚未测量，因此这是它的独立 GPU。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:381
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name, %2 a computer model"
msgid ""
"Automatic draws players, and any program started in 3D, on %1 whatever the "
"power profile, on battery too: it was measured best for them on the %2."
msgstr "“自动”在 %1 上绘制播放器以及任何以 3D 启动的程序，无论电源配置如何，使用电池时也是如此：在 %2 上测得它对它们最佳。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:387
msgctxt "@info %1 is a GPU name"
msgid ""
"Automatic draws players, and any program started in 3D, on %1 whatever the "
"power profile, on battery too: it was measured best for them on this "
"computer."
msgstr "“自动”在 %1 上绘制播放器以及任何以 3D 启动的程序，无论电源配置如何，使用电池时也是如此：在此计算机上测得它对它们最佳。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:412
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This computer has not been measured for it, so it is Off unless you turn it "
"on."
msgstr "此计算机未就此测量，因此除非您打开，否则为关闭。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:414
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "This computer's measured setting: On."
msgstr "此计算机测得的设置：开。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:414
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "This computer's measured setting: Off."
msgstr "此计算机测得的设置：关。"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:481
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "Same as its group"
msgstr "与所属分组相同"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:482
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "The other GPU"
msgstr "另一个 GPU"

#: src/graphicskcm.cpp:483
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox"
msgid "The main GPU"
msgstr "主 GPU"
